Smooth (eased) editor scrolling behind `smooth_scroll.enabled`, off by default.

Based on zed-industries/zed#44827 (closed unmerged), rebased onto Zed 1.20.2.
With the setting off every scroll path is upstream's; with it on, mouse wheel
and scroll actions animate over 125 ms with a cubic ease-out.

